  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can turn death into magical flames that heal or incinerate. When a Small or larger creature dies within 30 feet of you or your wildfire spirit, a harmless spectral flame springs up in its space and flickers there for 1 minute. When a creature you can see enters that space, you can take a Reaction to extinguish the flame and either heal the creature or deal Fire damage to it, equal to 2d10 plus your Wisdom modifier. You can take this Reaction a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
